<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ridgeline Ops — Hire, Train, and Rent Farm Machinery Operators</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <p style="color: var(--ochre); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">MUSCLE FOR EVERY ACRE</p>
        <h1>Get the right hands on your farm machinery.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Ridgeline Ops connects Nigerian farmers with trained operators, offers hands-on training for new operators, and lets you rent the equipment itself — all from one place.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/hire" class="btn btn-primary">Hire an Operator</a>
          <a href="/register-operator" class="btn btn-outline">Register as an Operator</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/hero-tractor.png" alt="Tractor ploughing a field on a Nigerian farm" class="hero-art">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Machinery on the platform</h2>
        <p>Every operator is tagged by the machine they run, and each machine is also available for direct rental or training.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="machine-grid">
        <% machines.forEach(m => { %>
          <div class="machine-card">
            <img src="/images/<%= m.icon %>" alt="<%= m.name %> in use on a Nigerian farm" class="<%= m.icon.endsWith('.svg') ? 'icon-img' : 'photo-img' %>">
            <h3><%= m.name %></h3>
            <p class="desc"><%= m.desc %></p>
            <div class="rates">
              <div>Rent/day<strong>₦<%= m.rentRate.toLocaleString() %></strong></div>
              <div>Training<strong>₦<%= m.trainFee.toLocaleString() %></strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How Ridgeline Ops works</h2>
        <p>Three simple paths depending on what you need.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Need an operator?</h3>
          <p>Browse registered operators by machine and location, then send a hire request directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Want to become one?</h3>
          <p>Register your skills and machine specialty so farmers can find and hire you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>New to the trade?</h3>
          <p>Sign up for training on the specific machine you want to learn, at a fee set per machine type.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
